  ('proof_financial_means', 'Proof of sufficient financial means for the living costs for the duration of the stay but only for a maximum of one year in advance', 'for students up to 24 years of age EUR 438.17 per month; over 24 years of age EUR 793.40 per month; these amounts include the rent for accommodation of up to EUR 253.51/month. If the rent is higher, additional funds have to be proved. These funds can be proved by means of a savings book at an Austrian bank, the proof of the purchase of travellers cheques or a declaration of guarantee of a person living in Austria.', 'financial', true, 7, 'https://www.migration.gv.at/fileadmin/downloads/infoblaetter/Leitfaden-Studi-engl.pdf'),
