  ('fee_payment_confirmation_from_hei', 'Confirmation from HEI that requisite fees have been paid', 'Provide evidence that you have paid the requisite fees at time of visa application. Where the course fees are less than €6,000, you must pay fees in full to the college before applying for your visa. Where the course fees are more than €6,000, you must pay at least this amount before applying for your visa. Evidence of this should be visible in your letter of acceptance. This minimum amount is an Immigration requirement. However, your course provider may ask for full payment of fees.', 'study', true, 8, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('electronic_transfer_of_funds', 'Electronic transfer of funds (EFTs)', 'You must provide copies of EFTs to the Irish Bank of the HEI, showing the beneficiary’s name, address, bank details and the same details for sender or a valid receipt showing that the course fees have been lodged to an approved student fees payment service.', 'study', true, 9, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('previous_educational_qualifications', 'Previous educational qualifications (inc. DigiLocker)', 'You must provide evidence that you have the ability to follow your chosen course. This must include all qualification awards and individual semester mark sheets. Where possible, applicants from India should also submit DigiLocker versions of their qualifications alongside originals. Secondary level qualifications are only required when you are applying for a level 7 or 8 bachelor degree in Ireland.', 'education', false, 10, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('english_language_certification', 'English language certification', 'Provide a certificate from an accepted test provider to show you have the required English language ability.', 'education', true, 11, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('employment_history', 'Employment history', 'If applicable, provide evidence of your employment history since leaving fulltime education. Evidence should include up-to-date letters from your current employer, recent payslips, letters of resignation from previous employers etc.', 'employment', false, 12, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('personal_bank_statements', 'Personal finances', 'You must provide personal bank statements.', 'finances', true, 13, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('sponsor_letters_and_id_documents', 'Sponsored finances', 'For any sponsors, you must provide signed letters of sponsorship and copies of their national identity documents. Gold valuations, chit funds and volatile funds (crypto or market-linked funds) are not accepted. Funds should be liquid and in verifiable bank accounts.', 'finances', false, 14, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('financial_summary_form', 'Financial summary form (FSF)', 'The FSF attempts to help you understand and summarise your financial requirements.', 'finances', true, 15, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('private_medical_insurance', 'Private medical insurance', 'Private Medical Insurance cover is required.', 'insurance', true, 16, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('police_clearance_certificates', 'Police clearance certificates', 'You must provide a police clearance certificate (PCC) for any country where you held residence permission (including Ireland or the United Kingdom) in the five years prior to your application. For country of current residence PCCs should be dated within six months of application. For countries of previous residence, within six month of departure.', 'criminal_history', true, 17, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf'),
  ('previous_visa_refusals', 'Previous visa refusals', 'Provide a letter detailing any refusals (country, reason for travel, dates, reasons for refusal etc.) and the refusal letters from the issuing country. If unavailable, explain why.', 'travel_history', true, 18, 'https://assets.ireland.ie/documents/NDVO_20250708_IRL_Visa_checklist_Study.pdf')
) as v(doc_key, name, description, category, is_required, sort_order, source_url);

