  ('parent_guardian_support_and_financial_proof', 'A letter of support from the parent/guardian accompanied by a bank guarantee certificate, or Previous 06 months of bank statement', 'Financial/support evidence listed for e-Student Visa.', 'financial', true, 3, 'https://indianvisaonline.gov.in/evisa/tvoa.html'),
